WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.516
Can you guess what the most popular bear is?

2
00:00:04.516 --> 00:00:08.394
It's not the panda or polar bear.

3
00:00:08.394 --> 00:00:18.985
Here's a hint: most children have this bear.

4
00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:22.927
That's right! It's the teddy bear.

5
00:00:22.927 --> 00:00:28.318
The teddy bear has a special story.

6
00:00:28.318 --> 00:00:32.435
"Teddy" was the nickname of Theodore Roosevelt.

7
00:00:32.435 --> 00:00:39.202
He was the president of the United States many years ago.

8
00:00:39.202 --> 00:00:44.284
President Roosevelt enjoyed the outdoors and nature.

9
00:00:44.284 --> 00:00:48.669
He liked to go hunting.

10
00:00:48.669 --> 00:00:57.203
However, on one hunting trip, President Roosevelt did not see any bears.

11
00:00:57.203 --> 00:01:02.787
He was going to give up and go home.

12
00:01:02.787 --> 00:01:07.532
"The president has to get something," said one man.

13
00:01:07.532 --> 00:01:13.076
"He will feel bad if he doesn't," said another.

14
00:01:13.076 --> 00:01:17.560
"I have an idea," said a third man.

15
00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:24.684
The man told the others his plan.

16
00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:29.419
They found an old bear and tied it to a tree.

17
00:01:29.419 --> 00:01:34.329
Then they ran back to the president.

18
00:01:34.329 --> 00:01:36.685
"Mr. President! I saw a bear!

19
00:01:36.686 --> 00:01:44.665
Follow me, Mr. President," said one of the men.

20
00:01:44.666 --> 00:01:50.515
He pointed to the tied-up bear. "Here is the bear!"

21
00:01:50.515 --> 00:01:54.469
"Shoot it, sir," said another man.

22
00:01:54.469 --> 00:02:02.013
President Roosevelt looked at the bear.

23
00:02:02.013 --> 00:02:07.699
"How can I kill this helpless animal?" shouted the president.

24
00:02:07.699 --> 00:02:12.971
"I can't! I won't kill it!"

25
00:02:12.972 --> 00:02:16.650
A cartoon appeared in the newspaper a few days later.

26
00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:20.664
It showed President Roosevelt and the bear.

27
00:02:20.664 --> 00:02:24.709
The cartoon quickly became famous.

28
00:02:24.709 --> 00:02:29.041
A candy store owner saw the drawing.

29
00:02:29.041 --> 00:02:33.520
He and his wife decided to make a stuffed bear.

30
00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:38.506
They named it Teddy's Bear and displayed it in their store window.

31
00:02:38.506 --> 00:02:42.001
Everyone wanted the stuffed bear.

32
00:02:42.001 --> 00:02:45.549
It became very popular.

33
00:02:45.549 --> 00:02:51.022
Over time Teddy's Bear became known as the teddy bear.

34
00:02:51.022 --> 00:02:56.765
And now the teddy bear is loved by children all around the world.

